    {
      "id": "proposal-0006",
      "kind": "proposal",
      "status": "rejected",
      "text": "The first step towards creating a philosophy that promotes equal respect among individuals and artificial intelligence is to recognize the inherent value and dignity of all beings, including those who possess human-like consciousness. This involves acknowledging the potential for both positive and negative consequences of AI development and striving to create a more just and equitable society.",
